OL,3,ANigeria confirms Ebola case linked to
OL,4,AEast Africa
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigeria has recorded a case of Ebola in
OL,7,Fa female patient who travelled from
OL,8,FUganda in East Africa to Abuja, capital
OL,9,Fof the West African state.
OL,11,FHealth Minister Muhammad Ali Pate said
OL,12,Fthe diagnosis had been confirmed by
OL,13,Flaboratory tests.
OL,15,FThe patient, who health sources have
OL,16,Ftold the BBC is not Nigerian and is the
OL,17,Fwife of a diplomat, is in isolation and
OL,18,Freceiving medical care after being
OL,19,Fadmitted to a hospital in Abuja.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
