OL,3,ANigeria confirms Ebola case linked to
OL,4,AEast Africa
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe developed symptoms on Wednesday 7
OL,7,FOctober, four days after arriving in
OL,8,Fthe country, according to the World
OL,9,FHealth Organization (WHO).
